    "id": "48983923596878857",
    "like_count": 24,
    "media_id": "55507623276553004",
    "parent_id": "57034992109858454",
    "text": "Sent you the corps photo from last night's rehearsal. Claire finally got them synchronized in that second act lift. Hous",
